{"server":"tw","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_st03","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_st03","title":"法外之徒","storyCode":"CV-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"6cf542354b26829c21895faec3ea3da992df5f36bd98703cbc81cee940051173","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭結束了，伍迪，你自由了。你可以回到拉特蘭，回到那棟父母留給你的小房子，在門廊前種滿玫瑰與月季……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後，找一家附近的教堂，把它們繪在天頂上，傾聽每一位來者的禱告，然後讓這些聲音伴你入夢，這樣，你便能安眠一整晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在倉庫裡找到了你的銃，他的……實在是找不到了，伍迪，就帶上它回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要留在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要留在哥倫比亞嗎……可戰爭已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，你的戰爭結束了，我的才剛剛開始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，嘿，伍迪……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昏迷了多長時間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些孩子看到我受傷了都很緊張，一時下手沒輕重。你被推倒時腦袋撞在了階梯上，當場就昏過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡她們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，她毫髮無傷。至於海倫娜女士，我派了人護送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預計半個月後，她就能安然抵達那家賭場，將所有錢洗得乾乾淨淨，再交給那位早已等在拓荒地的西爾維婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你沒叫人去追嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我一早就說了，我只關心合約上的事，上面要求我拖拽地塊到指定的位置，並在拖拽期間維護地塊治安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地塊外的事情，裡面沒提到，我不關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我是個冷血的混蛋，但我也不喜歡趴在別人的血肉上飽餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼處置我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在哥倫比亞南部有一幢私宅，裡面有一間很大的花房，是個好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以更名換姓去那裡安度晚年，我會安排好一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在那裡住過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從沒有，聽地產商是這麼跟我說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝你的好意，但地產商的話信不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你無意把我交給法庭，那我就要離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的銃我放在了桌子上，半個月後有最後一列去往拓荒地的車隊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以先接電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要喝茶嗎，先生？一路趕來，真的辛苦了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃，謝謝，潔西卡小姐。既然您的家族花費高薪將我僱傭，我理當竭誠為您服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搶劫銀行是重罪……這官司很難吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"分情況，不同的需求，不同的難度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您對監獄沒有那麼抗拒的話，我們會為您爭取最短的刑期，舒適的環境，出來後沒人會記得您所做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事我們經常做，只要錢到位就沒什麼難度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，還有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，很少有人想待在牢獄裡面，我們還有另一套計劃，您可以在家裡面，或者某個風景秀美的別墅裡待上一陣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也在當局的監視下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你們有難度嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"有，但不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您一天牢也不想坐，只想假裝無事發生，立刻恢復正常的生活……很難，但也不是不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在哥倫比亞，去監獄的罪犯其實很少，更多人是會被發往拓荒地的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心，潔西卡小姐……有我們在，結果不會糟糕到那個地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……我是說自己想去拓荒地，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該在那裡。我觸犯了法律，這是我應該付出的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您要我這樣向布林雷先生回覆嗎，潔西卡小姐？對我來說，這才是最有難度的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……阻止我做想做的事情，才是最難的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那是完完全全的……不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的律師","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"真是堅定……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，很堅定……比以前的選擇都要堅定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真不打算接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我從來沒和任何人講過，我真的很討厭電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實能看出來，現在你的眉頭能夾起一張紙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，沒錯，每當電話響起，我只想舉起銃將它射成篩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想過無數次，但每一次，我都只能壓抑下衝動，然後將它接起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一通電話而已……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟它在戰場上待兩個月，什麼都變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從傍晚守到黎明，你一接起它，裡面的聲音說“進攻”。我只能聽令，帶著手下的士兵去衝鋒陷陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從黎明戰鬥至傍晚，你帶著剩下的人回來，還來不及休息，電話又響了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面的聲音下令“守住陣地”，然後所有人返回前線，繼續無窮無盡的鬥爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就此分別吧，伍迪，如果我早已失去在你葬禮上致詞的資格，那麼我希望你能答應我唯一的請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別死在我不知道的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……行，有句話留給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果回不了頭，回個電話總是可以的，你也不必每次都被動地守著它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你永遠記得這通電話。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拿起桌上的電話，他按下幾個數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，行長先生。我剛剛有些事情，沒有接到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，拖拽期間出了些亂子。我明白您焦急的心情，但是對我來說，只要將地塊帶到指定位置，任務就算圓滿結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他一切都算是小插曲，沒人會在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我明白，那筆錢對您很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您正在事業上升期，那些從特里蒙來的傢伙會幫您更上一層樓。但是現在錢沒了，我猜他們一定不會放過您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我知道您並不在乎他們。您上面有些更難對付的人，那些人才是真正決定您命運的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我理解，我都理解……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果我能幫您補上那個漏洞呢？雖然不是小數目，但我掏得起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為回報，您或許也可以幫我個小忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些文件，希望您能簽署，並在之後保密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您那邊有人在敲門？對，看來我的傭兵們把文件送到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……您不敢簽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是次雙贏的合作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半小時後我會再打一通電話給您，希望到時您已經考慮好了，回頭見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘書","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克里夫先生，錢款已經準備好了，只等那位行長先生做決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘書","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是……我們前些日子拿下玻利瓦爾的平台時，可比這次順利多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那畢竟是玻利瓦爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦爾沒有那位掀起風潮的科學家，也沒有擠破頭想抓住每個廢棄地塊的科技企業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘書","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不僅如此，玻利瓦爾在地塊的價格和出讓手續上也很爽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟他們並不排斥和我們搞好關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘書","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別抱怨事情不順了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和平的弦繃得越緊，兩頭的人就越想掌握能切斷它的那把快刀。可一旦徹底砍斷，那把刀要麼快點抽身，要麼就只能繼續被握在手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經被一個比玻利瓦爾強大得多的傢伙耽誤得太緊太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想讓那個大傢伙稍微鬆一鬆手，甚至硌疼他，讓他知道斷了的弦意味著什麼，我們以後還不知道要處理多少達維鎮這樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個他不屑放在眼皮下的老舊平台……嘖，說不定它的作用比我們預計的更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘書","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們只考慮最切近的影響，黑鋼在玻利瓦爾和哥倫比亞東部邊境設立的這兩處訓練中心，也確實能極大提升這些區域的治安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果連這些都不在乎，我們和那些只知道拿錢辦事的傢伙……不，和那些“大傢伙”，又有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那都是以後的事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那位行長打回來了，看來這個決定對他來說沒那麼難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要一起聽嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們為什麼要選在這個時候啟航啊……我還想去送送潔西卡和伍德洛先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別抱怨啦，快來收拾你的衣服吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堆得滿地都是……嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你們都不著急，潔西卡去了拓荒地，以後我們再見面就不知道是什麼時候啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克里夫先生沒有批准潔西卡的離職申請……就算去了拓荒地，她還是黑鋼的員工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，可是她這次去拓荒地……是、是要服刑的啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯……帶著黑鋼員工的身份……和工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，去哪裡也躲不掉的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定哪天在拓荒地出任務，我們就得去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快把這一地的衣服收起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛……都瞞著我，我還以為以後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪我們哦，誰叫你們工程崗總是忙得不見人影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我在衣服口袋裡摸到了一張字條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大驚小怪。又不是鈔票。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在半個月前，羅拉曾穿著那件外套，擁別了自己的朋友。\n那時她遞給了對方一張字條，沒有注意到對方其實也在她口袋裡塞了一張字條。\n背過房間裡其餘兩人，羅拉展開了那張字條。\n上面有幾個數字，還有一段潦草的話：\n“如果缺經費，就打這個電話。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再來一輪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您已經在這個小酒館坐一晚上了。老闆都快打烊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我認識這裡的老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在等人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不等，這輩子不等人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是別人等您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能等到您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我的人可太多了，你說的哪一位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠的不說，說近的，正等您的那位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能，一定能，我向別人打過包票，肯定是要去見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這樣重信重諾的人不多了，唉，我請您喝一杯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我這麼久，就是為了請我喝一杯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不管您信還是不信，我也向人打過包票，一定得讓等您的那個女孩等到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以叫我蒂拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g12_snowfield"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一片焦土中，我看見有火星亮起，隨風飄向遠方，又湮滅為煙灰。\n抑或將夜幕灼燒，露出天光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的打算和我一起去拓荒地嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你拋下的是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，也許幾年後，幾個月後，甚至幾天之後……我就會覺得，自己做了個愚蠢的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我只能依靠現在，只能依靠此時此刻的心去做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我現在覺得它值得孤注一擲，我就沒有理由不付諸行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡真的會有你追逐的東西嗎，潔西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前……我總是竭盡全力去追逐一些我根本追不上的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"童年時我試圖追趕兄姊那比我還高的長腿，少年時祖父去世，我人在異地，又要追趕一場趕不上的葬禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長大後……我又在追趕一場場無法阻止的禍事與紛爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永遠在追趕，但永遠也來不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次不一樣，這次我不追了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為從一開始，我就會在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便走吧，潔西卡，做好準備，在那裡一切都要重新來過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不開心，潔西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的城堡倒了，花了一個下午，現在什麼都沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，你把城堡堆在沙灘上，它自然會被浪推倒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……是我太笨，沒能給它找個安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看你的小腦袋又在胡思亂想什麼了？你是我的孫女，怎麼可能會笨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是哥哥姐姐都比我聰明……比我懂的多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們都是成年人了，自然閱歷要比你豐富，等你長大了，也會像他們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但那時他們不會更厲害嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦……你的怪問題怎麼這麼多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別沮喪了……讓我和你一起把沙堡復原吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎……？可是就算復原了，明天還是會被波浪推倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後……什麼都沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，如果你害怕被浪花推倒，那我們就選一片離海水更遠的沙灘，重建一座沙堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當一切都失去時，未來仍然存在……我們依然要對它抱有信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要懼怕重新來過……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，那便重新來過吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一頂溫暖的帽子被扣在女孩頭上。帽檐很寬，幾乎蓋住她大半張臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想哭就哭出來吧……經歷了這麼多……想必也不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要為哭泣而感到羞恥……潔西卡，新生都是從哭泣開始的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是呼吸的第一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默許久後，終於，一聲啜泣從帽子下響起。\n老人沒有低頭看，而是將目光投向雪原的盡頭。\n地平線處的天空被朝霞染紅，倒映在光潔的雪地。\n那一片朱紅色讓他雙目刺痛，幾欲落下淚水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
